For HF exchange FSE benchmarks, the following geometries are used:

	- Diamond: C/1.000.vasp
	- Silicon: Si/1.000.vasp
	- h-BN: hBN/1.000.vasp
	- Lithium: Li/1.000.vasp
	- Aluminum: Al/1.000.vasp

The same geometry of diamond is also used for band structure calculations.
For the diamond equation of state, all geometries in the "C" folder are
used, which corresponds to scanning the cell volume from 90% to 110% of
"C/1.000.vasp".

The three molecular crystals can be found in "molcrys" folder.
